@startuml
[*] --> Initializing
Initializing --> Ready : StartupCheckPassed
Initializing --> Stopped : StartupCheckFailed
Ready --> Activated : Activate
Ready --> Stopped : UserPasswordEntered
Activated --> Monitoring : SensorTriggered
Activated --> Stopped : UserPasswordEntered
Monitoring --> Activated : FalseAlarmOrTimeout
Monitoring --> Monitoring : SensorTriggered
Monitoring --> Stopped : UserPasswordEntered
Ready --> Ready : Reset

